      "en": "If I send them away fasting to their home, they will faint on the way, for some of them have come a long way.”",
      "ko": "만일 내가 저희를 굶겨 집으로 보내면 길에서 기진하리라 그 중에는 멀리서 온 사람도 있느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "140e3efa69bb26d364ac81ce86a3469050f5a2ae24de1050e15ac14cc38fc88d",
      "translation_text_hash": "c9dfe36121847714bbe55534ea589ffbfee8bc79094023c03418970138dcbf8b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
