      "en": "The Pharisees came out and began to question him, seeking from him a sign from heaven and testing him.",
      "ko": "바리새인들이 나와서 예수께 힐난하며 그를 시험하여 하늘로서 오는 표적을 구하거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "e9cd94adf7c2379b96e426d4ae7d97dfee2a9c953c2a80b83b409ec9723bfc51",
      "translation_text_hash": "77aed0a7a5c19380370de1ba0c6cae4e609fcdc6b06423417ad4313fa2d0278e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
