      "en": "He called the multitude to himself with his disciples and said to them, “Whoever wants to come after me, let him deny himself, and take up his cross, and follow me.",
      "ko": "무리와 제자들을 불러 이르시되 아무든지 나를 따라 오려거든 자기를 부인하고 자기 십자가를 지고 나를 좇을 것이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b1ffcdf1a2784a45689d48aeb54a7d1bf405164820f1eb6e1db5bd60266277fb",
      "translation_text_hash": "1d210205192970730f780391481daf4156e2e5abee93c28794072c6776918a6e",
